###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Errors are in kJ/mol per Si or per atom, which the schema has no unit for; they are recorded with unit null and the unit in the label.
# - The MatterSim version and the ORB-v3 checkpoint are not stated; all universal models are paper-local runs (PFP is a TeaNet model). Geometric errors (Fig. 1) are not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/ito2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

